  "Sports Scholarships Scheme (2025)",
  "The University of Sussex offers tiered support to high-performing athletes via our Sports Scholarships Scheme. The scholarships are available to students who have demonstrated sporting excellence prior to joining Sussex and are committed to developing their sporting performance while here.",
